Short:        C++ Library, SAS/C binaries
Author:       armin@uni-paderborn.de (Armin Vogt)
Uploader:     armin uni-paderborn de (Armin Vogt)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.10
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is the NEW version 1.10 by Aug, 30, 1994 of A++ Library.

The archive contains the executables and the link library for SAS/C++.

This archive expands to a new directory 'APlusPlus' in the current work
directory. If you have already unpacked APPSource.lha expand this archive
in the same directory you unpacked APPSource.lha.
